        ],
        "text": "The Republic of the Philippines claims that it owns certain assets that were allegedly misappropriated by former President Marcos, and that under Philippine law those assets have always been the property of the Republic."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States (amicus) and Mr. Rothfeld",
        "citations": [
