            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2aae9e6ab554-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case raises the question of whether the Republic\u2019s sovereign immunity bars the lawsuit, a point that both the United States (amicus) and counsel for the Republic argue should be given great weight."
      }
